#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:1
#: e07f072885ea469c966b7a73bdee77bb
msgid "查看数据分布（Explore distributions）"
msgstr "Explore Data Distributions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:3
#: cce7e1c7c1424e409a2329d1ad712f49
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:5
#: 80afbd2172bc445fb2ac1d2dc9412cc0
msgid ""
"在统一的训练集评估页面中查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差分布，并从分箱反向"
"选择结构。 适合先看整体长尾，再追到对应结构，而不是逐帧浏览。"
msgstr "Inspect energy, force, virial, prediction, or error distributions on the unified Training Set Audit page, and select structures back from histogram bins. This supports reviewing the overall tails first and then tracing them to structures instead of browsing frame by frame."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:8
#: fb17b82ae59c4b32a116060ebde72f98
msgid "可选字段与联动"
msgstr "Fields and Linked Selection"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9007
#: 36aa65f2f3c94f9986335126d831e4ec
msgid ""
"点击后打开 `训练集评估 → 数据分布`，不再弹出独立的 Distribution Inspector 窗"
"口。"
msgstr "The action now opens `Training Set Audit → Data Distributions` instead of a separate Distribution Inspector window."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9008
#: 4c1b884232644e448fed7ed352076953
msgid "默认只需要选择 `字段 / 数值类型 / 分组方式 / 数据范围`。"
msgstr "By default, choose only `Field / Value type / Grouping / Data range`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9009
#: 4265322d6a364b59af80361f6506ff47
msgid "`选择方式 / 分箱数 / 辅助曲线 / 向量模长` 收入“高级选项”。"
msgstr "`Selection mode / Bin count / Auxiliary curve / Vector magnitude` are under Advanced options."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9010
#: f12c85ef38074aa896ea3e1b2ec46fe8
msgid ""
"`Metric / Series` 与分布图联动；点击分箱会把对应结构选择回写到 Dataset "
"Display。"
msgstr "`Metric / Series` are linked to the distribution plot; clicking a bin sends the corresponding structure selection back to Dataset Display."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9011
#: 8bf64487ac4f46318dc807b893614bf7
msgid "Reference / Prediction / Error 只在底层数据支持时产生有效结果。"
msgstr "Reference, Prediction, and Error produce valid results only when the underlying data provides them."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9013
#: 9fe7105e603d467b9d02a8cc43053c49
msgid "原有独立窗口暂时作为兼容实现保留，但工具栏入口已经切换到统一页面。"
msgstr "The former standalone window remains temporarily for compatibility, but the toolbar action now uses the unified page."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:15
#: e13b2efd940b42a8b5f313ec16bf6f55
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:17
#: 1b1847625f2b4ae0940feb285c172001
msgid ""
"确认当前字段是否真的提供 Reference、Prediction 或 Error。点击分箱后检查回写的"
"结构数量； 分布只描述当前活动数据，已经删除的结构不在统计范围内。"
msgstr "Confirm that the current field actually provides Reference, Prediction, or Error. After clicking a bin, check the number of structures selected back in Dataset Display. The distribution covers only active data; deleted structures are excluded."
